if-else se program faisla leta hai:

```python
umar = int(input('Umar dalo: '))
if umar >= 18:
    print('Tum vote de sakte ho')
else:
    print('Abhi umar kam hai')
```

if matlab 'agar shart sahi hai to ye karo', else matlab 'warna ye karo'.

